From: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: sun4i-a10-i2s: allow an audio-graph port

The controller can be used as the CPU side of an audio-graph-card2 link,
which needs a "port" node; with unevaluatedProperties: false it is
rejected by dtbs_check today.

Signed-off-by: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
index 739114f..a873060 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
@@ -60,6 +60,10 @@ properties:
   resets:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  port:
+    $ref: audio-graph-port.yaml#
+    unevaluatedProperties: false
+
 allOf:
   - $ref: dai-common.yaml#
   - if:
